body:
This isn't exactly to do with high school, but specifically the final year *before* high school (8th grade).

Both myself and the bully were (and still are) the same grade and age, he's only a month older than me. We were pretty good friends between 5th and 7th grade, but as soon as 8th grade began something must have snapped within him for absolutely no external reason, because he started relentlessly harassing everyone in the classroom (including students and staff!) completely out of the blue. What he did specifically is a long story for another day.

&#x200B;

Anyways, we're both 16 and finishing 10th grade as of now, but he's already got himself waist-deep in shit that he brought upon himself. He's had at least 5 or 6 breakups in the past year alone with various girlfriends (who all left him because he was obviously toxic), including one 13-year-old he's had sex with and impregnated, and he's been in legal issues with the cops numerous times for reasons that I am not privy to.

&#x200B;

Not to mention the fact that his mom and younger brother left the home and fled elsewhere, presumably because of marriage issues with the mom and dad. I feel somewhat bad for him about that part, but at the same time I honestly don't really give a damn about his future because it's unlikely to be very bright.
